{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1283684-hundred-devils-adversary-of-the-righteous-package","id":1283684,"title":"Hundred Devils/Adversary of the Righteous package?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-01-30T05:05:06-08:00","id":1283684,"title":"Hundred Devils/Adversary of the Righteous package?","content":"Y'know what I would like, as a customer of Onyx Path products, and specifically Exalted in general? A package on DrivethruRPG, that is:<br /> <br /> 1. You can download all the Hundred Devils or Adversary stuff (one package for each) currently existing.<br /> 2. When the full deal comes out, you own that.<br /> <br /> Is that something that would be possible? Or is patience and anticipation the way forward?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T05:18:18-08:00","id":1283685,"title":"","content":"The plan is that Hundred Devils and Adversaries will be a complete book and will be released as such. Onyx Path just releases the content piecemeal <i>as well.</i> If you own all the individual PDF's you will get the PDFs for the final books at a discount/for free (I'm not sure what exactly they've said on this, but I believe the intent is that you don't have to pay for it twice).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8097-wern212","name":"wern212","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8097_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"377"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T05:23:40-08:00","id":1283686,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wern212</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1283684-hundred-devils-adversary-of-the-righteous-package?p=1283685#post1283685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The plan is that Hundred Devils and Adversaries will be a complete book and will be released as such. Onyx Path just releases the content piecemeal <i>as well.</i> If you own all the individual PDF's you will get the PDFs for the final books at a discount/for free (I'm not sure what exactly they've said on this, but I believe the intent is that you don't have to pay for it twice).</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, that I did not know. But no specifics then for the final book pdf? Half price or free? And what if you only have a couple of the relevant pdfs? Pay the difference get the final pdf?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8959-prototype00","name":"prototype00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8959_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"964"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-30T05:38:48-08:00","id":1283695,"title":"","content":"I think, from what Rich said, they haven't quite decided how it'll work, precisely. It may depend on Drivethru.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-31T14:43:04-08:00","id":1284011,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wern212</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1283684-hundred-devils-adversary-of-the-righteous-package?p=1283685#post1283685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The plan is that Hundred Devils and Adversaries will be a complete book and will be released as such. Onyx Path just releases the content piecemeal <i>as well.</i> If you own all the individual PDF's you will get the PDFs for the final books at a discount/for free (I'm not sure what exactly they've said on this, but I believe the intent is that you don't have to pay for it twice).</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, there's going to be some kind of discount if you've bought all the PDFs? And here I was, not buying any of them because I wanted to wait for the full book(s).<br /> <br /> This is good news, but I'm still reluctant to start buying them without knowing for sure how the deal's going to work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"htt